    "author": "2069720028061011968",
    "displayName": "2069720028061011968",
    "text": "DAX g\u00fcn\u00fc sert bir d\u00fc\u015f\u00fc\u015fle kapatt\u0131. Endeks -%1,60 ile 25.213,31 puanda kapand\u0131. 12 hissenin 12 tanesi ekside kapand\u0131, yani sat\u0131\u015f genele yay\u0131lm\u0131\u015f durumda. En \u00e7ok gerileyenler Deutsche Bank -%2,97, Continental -%2,57 ve Airbus -%2,52 oldu.\n\nTeknik g\u00f6stergelerde #SMA-50 25.698,31, #SMA-200 24.876,86, #RSI-14 46,4 seviyesinde. Endeks 50 g\u00fcnl\u00fck ortalaman\u0131n alt\u0131nda i\u015flem g\u00f6r\u00fcyor. \u0130zledi\u011fim bant 24.792,79 - 25.783,16 aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda. Bu band\u0131n d\u0131\u015f\u0131na bir g\u00fcnl\u00fck kapan\u0131\u015f gelmeden y\u00f6n de\u011fi\u015fti demek i\u00e7in hen\u00fcz erken.\n\nY\u0131lba\u015f\u0131ndan bug\u00fcne DAX +%2,75 getiri verdi. 52 haftal\u0131k bant 21.863,81 \u2013 26.618,74 aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ve fiyat \u015fu an bu band\u0131n %70 seviyesinde. Y\u0131l i\u00e7i getiri olumlu olsa da endeks zirveden uzak kalabiliyor; bunlar birbirinden ayr\u0131 iki soru. Son 1 ay -%0,36, son 5 g\u00fcn -%0,25 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor. K\u0131sa vadeli tablo orta vadeli tabloyla \u00f6rt\u00fc\u015fm\u00fcyorsa, k\u0131sa hareketin kal\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 de\u011ferlendirmeden \u00f6nce 1 ayl\u0131k g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcme bakmak gerekiyor.\n\nEndeksi mi izliyorsunuz, yoksa piyasa geni\u015fli\u011fini mi?\n\n#DAX #AlmanBorsasi",
    "createdAt": "Mon Oct 19 15:27:35 +0000 2026",
    "url": "https://x.com/DaxTR_Analiz/status/2112204018726445272"
  },
